  "description": "R-PAR-1 PAR-ERROR, SQL-DEMAND, SQL-UNION-04: With arm A = ids below 50 of ER (49 rows) and arm B = CLng(tx) over all of ER (tx = 'x' at id 60): are the rows of A delivered before the error of B, and which GetRows(30) call fails, for A UNION ALL B, A UNION B, B UNION ALL A, A UNION ALL B ORDER BY v, TOP 5 over A UNION ALL B (outer and inside the arms), each read by eight successive GetRows(30) calls? Runs on a fresh copy of r-par-1-error opened read-only through DAO OpenDatabase in one process and one STA; each statement is opened with Database.OpenRecordset as a snapshot unless stated, and every call's result, HRESULT and DBEngine.Errors are captured.",
